  "description": "WIGVIR crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H77 N24 O5 Sm3 4+,4(I1 1-),2.5(C6 H6),2(C4 H6 N2),C4 H8 O1. From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 3 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.643-3.660 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 95.77-102.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H77N24O5Sm3·4I·2.5C6H6·2C4H6N2·C4H8O.",
